{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Roguelike About Research and Corruption</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Veilbreaker, you find yourself in the K2-18 star system, where everything has collapsed. The game takes you through waves of enemies until you discover a rift in the solar system. By opening the rift, you unlock a new game mode in which, during a single run, you gain access to powerful upgrades while battling an ever-increasing corruption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this retro-inspired roguelike bullet hell, you raise the world tier to face greater threats but with them come even more threats.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Game Modes</strong><br>Unlock new game modes and fight your way forward!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress Through Research</strong><br>Unlock new powers and even plants. These strongly affect your available strategies and how far you can progress. Customize which plants you use to take on challenges and reach the end!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Experience</strong><br>If the game feels too hard or too easy, you can tailor the experience using a built-in difficulty adjuster. All players are welcome!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Core</strong><br>Several game modes are built around a roguelike core, where you gain and upgrade powers during a run, alongside a system that allows you to push further each time you start over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you reach the true ending or give up along the way?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game for those who love challenging roguelikes and bullet hells.<br><strong>Your story begins here!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3908430?t=1773917770","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908430/3823c931c0c6ef160cd2a874b95f4b0dc9c2e0cf/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773917770","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908430/2e083a37d4bb73672d99d93038933188a7c6b4ea/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773917770","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908430/2e083a37d4bb73672d99d93038933188a7c6b4ea/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773917770","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Roguelike About Research and Corruption</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Veilbreaker, you find yourself in the K2-18 star system, where everything has collapsed. The game takes you through waves of enemies until you discover a rift in the solar system. By opening the rift, you unlock a new game mode in which, during a single run, you gain access to powerful upgrades while battling an ever-increasing corruption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this retro-inspired roguelike bullet hell, you raise the world tier to face greater threats but with them come even more threats.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Game Modes</strong><br>Unlock new game modes and fight your way forward!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress Through Research</strong><br>Unlock new powers and even plants. These strongly affect your available strategies and how far you can progress. Customize which plants you use to take on challenges and reach the end!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Experience</strong><br>If the game feels too hard or too easy, you can tailor the experience using a built-in difficulty adjuster. All players are welcome!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Core</strong><br>Several game modes are built around a roguelike core, where you gain and upgrade powers during a run, alongside a system that allows you to push further each time you start over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you reach the true ending or give up along the way?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game for those who love challenging roguelikes and bullet hells.<br><strong>Your story begins here!</strong></p>","developers":["Glistening Leaf Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908430/0e8c702b896a1651ded075540826169c28e98d4d/header.jpg?t=1773917770","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3908430/857374236/fa796cee0642d739605a461aa25010fd67b0ef8d/1769694594/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769695131","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3908430/857374236/fa796cee0642d739605a461aa25010fd67b0ef8d/1769694594/dash_h264.mpd?t=1769695131","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3908430/857374236/fa796cee0642d739605a461aa25010fd67b0ef8d/1769694594/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1769695131","id":257275346,"name":"Gameplay Trailer 2026","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257275346/853a4f96e95f9e873c525e033795fcb2d2631271/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1769695131"}],"name":"Veilbreaker","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_u